REGENT OF TANAH BUMBU SOUTH KALIMANTAN PROVINCE
REGIONAL REGULATION OF TANAH BUMBU REGENCY NUMBER 12 YEAR
CONCERNING
IMPLEMENTATION OF WOMEN'S EMPOWERMENT AND
CHILD PROTECTION
BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD
THE REGENT OF TANAH BUMBU,

Considering : a. that Women and Children have the right to obtain protection from torture, threats, pressure, and have the right to obtain equal treatment and opportunities to obtain justice and welfare in accordance with the mandate of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
b. that Women's Empowerment and protecting the rights of Children is the obligation of the Regional Government and the Community in the Region;
c. that based on the provisions of Article 12 paragraph (2) letter b and letter H Division of Government Affairs in the Field of Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Appendix to Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government as has been amended several times most recently by Law Number 6 of 2023 concerning Stipulation of Government Regulation in Lieu of Law Number 2 of 2022 concerning Job Creation into Law, the Regional Government has the authority to implement Women's Empowerment and Child Protection in the Region;
d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b, and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Women's Empowerment and Child Protection;

In View of : 1. Law Number 4 of 1979 concerning Child Welfare (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1979 Number 32, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3143);
2. Law Number 7 of 1984 concerning Ratification of the Convention on the Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination Against Women (Convention on the Elemination of All Forms of Discrimination Againts Women) (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1984 Number 29, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3277);
3. Law Number 39 of 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1999 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);
4. Law Number 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2002 Number 102, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4235) as has been amended several times most recently by Law Number 1 of 2023 concerning the Criminal Code (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2023 Number 1, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 6842);
5. Law Number 13 of 2003 concerning Manpower (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2003 Number 39, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4279) as has been amended several times most recently by Law Number 6 of 2023 concerning Stipulation of Government Regulation in Lieu of Law Number 2 of 2022 concerning Job Creation into Law (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2023 Number 41, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 6856);
6. Law Number 6 of 2014 concerning Villages (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2014 Number 7, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5495) as has been amended several times most recently by Law Number 6 of 2023 concerning Stipulation of Government Regulation in Lieu of Law Number 2 of 2022 concerning Job Creation into Law (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2023 Number 41, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 6856);
7. Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2014 Number 244, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5587) as has been amended several times most recently by Law Number 6 of 2023 concerning Stipulation of Government Regulation in Lieu of Law Number 2 of 2022 concerning Job Creation into Law (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2023 Number 41, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 6856);
8. Law Number 8 of 2016 concerning Persons with Disabilities (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2016 Number 69, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5871);
9. Law Number 17 of 2023 concerning Health (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2023 Number 105, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 6887);
10. Presidential Regulation Number 25 of 2021 concerning Child-Friendly Regency/City Policy (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2021 Number 96);
11. Regional Regulation of Tanah Bumbu Regency Number 19 of 2016 concerning Formation and Composition of Regional Apparatus (Regional Gazette of Tanah Bumbu Regency Year 2016 Number 19) as has been amended several times most recently by Regional Regulation of Tanah Bumbu Regency Number 5 of 2021 concerning Second Amendment to Regional Regulation of Tanah Bumbu Regency Number 19 of 2016 concerning Formation and Composition of Regional Apparatus (Regional Gazette of Tanah Bumbu Regency Year 2021 Number 5);
12. Regional Regulation of Tanah Bumbu Regency Number 11 of 2021 concerning Implementation of Child-Friendly Regency (Regional Gazette of Tanah Bumbu Regency Year 2021 Number 11, Supplement to the Regional Gazette of Tanah Bumbu Regency Number 126);

